  "historical_rows_with_added_evidence": {
    "1053": "The current gunner methods own ground movement, the hide sequence and shadow drawing. The native projectile constructor accepts the shooter and typed start and target vectors. The model archive and four battle tables use the shared types. Lower-level state and collision call sites still need comparison"
  },
  "historical_rows_reconfirmed": {
    "451": "The current native 0x3A8 class declares the 16 IDs and has layout checks for the six recovered offsets. Creation uses a native C++ constructor",
    "583": "The current native center constructor and destructor emit the original vtable. The seven-state controller is byte exact and the emulator checks room and group filtering, ordering and dispatch",
    "656": "The current native hide handler walks the typed ID array, calls the gunner receivers, and writes the original timeout and state",
    "870": "The current header removes the manual center construction and projectile destructor bridges. The center and Dark Gunner keep their existing native factory names"
  },
